      "description": "The paper reports both that M7C3 transforms into M23C6 after service and that M23C6 transforms into M7C3 after carburization. These are opposite transformation directions.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 3,
          "section": "1. Introduction",
          "quote": "At first, the M7C3 type carbide of HPNb alloy change into M23C6 carbides after service [13]. Then, the metallurgical alteration of ethylene pyrolysis furnace tube after carburization is that the M23C6 carbide transforms into M7C3 type carbide in carburized zone at temperature ranges from 1123 K to1373 K[7,9,14].",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null
